Rossweisse...

7277
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:35,420
One down.

7278
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,380
He's too fast!

7279
00:02:39,090 --> 00:02:43,970
While improving upon your strengths, you do
not forget the pursuit of new techniques.

7280
00:02:43,970 --> 00:02:47,270
However, your lack of defense is your weakness.

7281
00:02:47,270 --> 00:02:50,890
There is no need to feel like
you failed against this blow.

7282
00:02:50,890 --> 00:02:54,730
You are not the only one who
cannot withstand this fist.

7283
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:03,530
That was a good wave of power!

7284
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:06,580
As expected of the Holy Sword Durandal.

7285
00:03:06,580 --> 00:03:10,000
However, it is still not
strong enough to stop me!

7286
00:03:13,830 --> 00:03:17,670
A new Balance Breaker! It cannot be helped!

7287
00:03:17,670 --> 00:03:20,840
Good blade strikes and speed.

7288
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:23,970
However, against me...

7289
00:03:23,970 --> 00:03:25,800
...they lack the toughness.

7290
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:30,770
Is that all the entertainment you can give me?

7291
00:03:35,230 --> 00:03:37,110
You let your guard down.

7292
00:03:43,570 --> 00:03:46,240
What is the meaning of this?!

7293
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:49,540
Didn't the participant Rosseweisse retire?

7294
00:03:49,540 --> 00:03:55,830
The Rossweisse that Sairaorg defeated earlier
was created through Excalibur Mimic!

7295
00:03:55,830 --> 00:03:59,960
The one who just appeared
is the real Rossweisse.

7296
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:05,430
She is holding Excalibur Transparency,
which makes even its wielder invisible.

7297
00:04:05,430 --> 00:04:08,010
She was carrying Excalibur...

7298
00:04:08,010 --> 00:04:11,270
Yes. When Ex-Durandal was modified,

7299
00:04:11,270 --> 00:04:15,350
Excalibur fragments were
incorporated into the sword.

7300
00:04:15,350 --> 00:04:20,320
She was able to borrow one of the
Excaliburs from Xenovia and use it.

7301
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:23,150
The reason she glowed when
she fell into the water,

7302
00:04:23,150 --> 00:04:27,780
was to make it look like she had retired.

7303
00:04:27,780 --> 00:04:31,910
Amazing! To think they had
planned that kind of an attack!

7304
00:04:36,290 --> 00:04:42,920
To your ingenious fighting style,
I give you my admiration...

7305
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,680
...along with this!

7306
00:04:51,970 --> 00:04:55,390
A Rook of Rias Gremory has retired!

7307
00:05:19,290 --> 00:05:20,840
Impressive.

7308
00:05:26,220 --> 00:05:30,010
With this, I must use our Phoenix Tears.

7309
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:40,360
I wish to fight in the finals fully prepared!

7310
00:05:47,030 --> 00:05:50,280
With this, we've fulfilled our roles.

7311
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:55,870
All that's left is for my Master
and my best friend to defeat you.

7312
00:05:55,870 --> 00:05:59,120
I am thankful for fighting against you all.

7313
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:05,170
Issei. President. Please be
sure to win against this man...

7314
00:06:06,170 --> 00:06:10,390
The two Knights of Rias Gremory have retired!

7315
00:06:10,390 --> 00:06:14,390
Yuto. Xenovia. Rossweisse.

7316
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:16,430
It was a brilliant match.

7317
00:06:19,690 --> 00:06:22,480
Now, we are reaching the end of the Game.

7318
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:25,780
The total this time is nine!

7319
00:06:25,780 --> 00:06:28,860
The Bael team sends out Kuisha Abaddon!

7320
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:33,410
The Gremory team sends out Hyoudou Issei!

7321
00:06:33,410 --> 00:06:36,500
Big Sister Rias... Issei is...

7322
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:40,170
Yes. He cares for his friends more than anyone.

7323
00:06:40,170 --> 00:06:42,540
He's about to explode.

7324
00:06:42,540 --> 00:06:46,170
Now, let the seventh match begin!

7325
00:06:46,170 --> 00:06:48,050
I can't hold back.

7326
00:06:48,050 --> 00:06:52,220
If you don't want to die, please put
all your strength in defense.

7327
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:56,310
If you do that, you can retire without dying.

7328
00:06:56,310 --> 00:06:58,350
Those are some big words.

7329
00:06:58,350 --> 00:06:59,810
Balance Break!

7330
00:06:59,810 --> 00:07:03,110
Welsh Dragon Balance Breaker!

7331
00:07:03,110 --> 00:07:05,190
I warned you.

7332
00:07:05,190 --> 00:07:07,780
Welsh Sonic Boost Knight!

7333
00:07:07,780 --> 00:07:09,570
Change Star Sonic!

7334
00:07:09,570 --> 00:07:11,360
Welsh Dragonic Rook!

7335
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:13,780
Change Solid Impact!

7336
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:19,660
The Queen of Sairaorg Bael has retired!

7337
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:23,330
What an attack!

7338
00:07:23,330 --> 00:07:27,090
Kuisha did not even have a chance to use Hole!

7339
00:07:27,090 --> 00:07:28,710
No, that's not it.

7340
00:07:28,710 --> 00:07:32,220
Abaddon disappeared even
before Issei's attack hit.

7341
00:07:32,220 --> 00:07:33,220
That's right.

7342
00:07:33,220 --> 00:07:36,680
I forced Kuisha to retire.

7343
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:40,930
She would have been killed by the
Red Dragon Emperor at that rate.

7344
00:07:40,930 --> 00:07:42,230
I'm sorry.

7345
00:07:42,230 --> 00:07:44,440
I can no longer hold back my feelings.

7346
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:48,030
Please consider that attack for
my juniors and forgive me.

7347
00:07:48,030 --> 00:07:52,950
That gaze of yours! It's so full of killing intent!

7348
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:57,950
I've dreamed of exchanging fists with the
Red Dragon Emperor for a long time.

7349
00:07:57,950 --> 00:08:00,870
So, isn't that enough with the rules?

7350
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:05,750
It would be foolish to make him
unable to fight, due to rules!

7351
00:08:05,750 --> 00:08:11,420
So! I would like to suggest a team
battle with the remaining members!

7352
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:16,220
Whoops?! A sudden suggestion from Sairaorg!

7353
00:08:16,220 --> 00:08:20,770
True. The battles after this would
be easy to read and boring.

7354
00:08:20,770 --> 00:08:23,020
Since a player cannot
participate twice in a row,

7355
00:08:23,020 --> 00:08:26,690
the next match would be Bael's Pawn
against Gremory's Bishop.

7356
00:08:26,690 --> 00:08:31,690
Then, the final match between
Sairaorg and the Red Dragon Emperor.

7357
00:08:31,690 --> 00:08:35,280
If that's the case, a decisive
team battle would be the better

7358
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:39,450
choice to keep up the excitement of this Game.

7359
00:08:39,450 --> 00:08:41,580
I am fine with that as well.

7360
00:08:46,290 --> 00:08:51,630
Um, I have just received notice that
Sairaorg's suggestion has been accepted.

7361
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:57,430
As such, the next match will be a team battle
with the remaining team members!

7362
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:02,640
That's how it is.

7363
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:07,650
I might overdo it and I won't tell
you not to hate me if you die,

7364
00:09:07,650 --> 00:09:10,270
but prepare yourself for
the possibility of death.

7365
00:09:10,270 --> 00:09:11,940
I plan on attacking to kill.

7366
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:19,370
If I don't, I won't be able to win
or face my retired allies!

7367
00:09:19,370 --> 00:09:21,120
I can't wait for this.

7368
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:42,640
Now, the final battle of Bael vs.
Gremory Game is about to begin!

7369
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:45,730
The Gremory side has set Asia as an alternate

7370
00:09:45,730 --> 00:09:49,400
and the remaining members of
both teams will be participating!

7371
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:52,650
Now, let the final match begin!

7372
00:09:52,650 --> 00:09:55,940
Rias, let me say this first.

7373
00:09:55,940 --> 00:10:00,410
Your family members think of you
so much it makes me jealous.

7374
00:10:00,410 --> 00:10:03,240
Because of that, they are all strong.

7375
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:06,460
Hyoudou Issei. It's finally time.

7376
00:10:06,460 --> 00:10:09,710
Welsh Dragon Balance Breaker!

7377
00:10:09,710 --> 00:10:12,540
I will get revenge for my comrades.

7378
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:16,220
I'm not enough of an adult to fight with
you calmly after my precious friends

7379
00:10:16,220 --> 00:10:18,430
have been beaten down by you!

7380
00:10:18,430 --> 00:10:23,350
Yes, perfect. That kind of mindset
is fitting for settling things!

7381
00:10:23,350 --> 00:10:24,930
Then, I won't hold back!

7382
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:36,860
This is just the beginning! Let's go, Ddraig!

7383
00:10:36,860 --> 00:10:37,610
Yeah!

7384
00:10:37,610 --> 00:10:41,240
Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost!
Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost!

7385
00:10:42,700 --> 00:10:47,910
That one was for my friends.
For their fists that didn't reach you!

7386
00:10:50,420 --> 00:10:52,840
Such a well-honed fist!

7387
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:55,840
I felt as if your spirit was flowing into me!

7388
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:11,520
W-What is that?!

7389
00:11:17,150 --> 00:11:22,910
What?! The mysterious Pawn of
the Bael team was a giant lion!

7390
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:24,990
It can't be... The Lion of Nemea?!

7391
00:11:24,990 --> 00:11:26,080
And that means?

7392
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:30,410
It was the Lion that fought against
Heracles in ancient mythology.

7393
00:11:30,410 --> 00:11:36,840
It was sealed into a Sacred Gear and
became one of the 13 Longinus.

7394
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:40,300
It was said to be powerful enough to
crack the very earth with a single swing.

7395
00:11:40,300 --> 00:11:44,890
A battle axe that could transform
into a giant lion, Regulus Nemea!

7396
00:11:44,890 --> 00:11:49,680
I heard his master had been
missing for many years...

7397
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:52,440
That's right, his master is dead.

7398
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:57,440
When I found him, he had already
been killed by a suspicious group.

7399
00:11:57,440 --> 00:12:04,070
But, the battle axe had turned into
a lion and destroyed that group.

7400
00:12:04,070 --> 00:12:06,830
That is when I made him part of my family.

7401
00:12:06,830 --> 00:12:10,500
A Longinus with intelligence
that can move without a master.

7402
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:12,410
Very interesting...

7403
00:12:12,410 --> 00:12:17,250
Since he has no master, his power is unstable.

7404
00:12:17,250 --> 00:12:20,760
Because of that, he can only
participate in matches with me.

7405
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:23,800
So that's why you didn't send
out your Pawn until the end.

7406
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:26,010
President, please take care of him!

7407
00:12:26,010 --> 00:12:29,470
Now that the shocking truth of the
mysterious Pawn has been revealed,

7408
00:12:29,470 --> 00:12:31,850
the battle begins once again!

7409
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:07,010
His right punch is weaker than his left punch.

7410
00:13:09,350 --> 00:13:12,100
On top of that, it's slightly slower!

7411
00:13:12,100 --> 00:13:14,480
We will not die easily.

7412
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:19,440
We will send you to the Red Dragon
Emperor in the best of states!

7413
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:22,070
Thanks for the pass, best friend!

7414
00:13:22,070 --> 00:13:25,740
Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost!

7415
00:13:25,740 --> 00:13:28,570
Here! Welsh Dragonic Rook!

7416
00:13:28,570 --> 00:13:30,910
Change Solid Impact!

7417
00:13:32,540 --> 00:13:36,710
Since you have no weaknesses,
my friends created one for me!

7418
00:13:36,710 --> 00:13:39,790
Welsh Blaster Bishop!

7419
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:42,500
Change Fang Blast!

7420
00:13:44,210 --> 00:13:46,680
Dragon Blaster!

7421
00:13:55,140 --> 00:13:57,980
So strong. It has this much power?!

7422
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:05,280
At this rate, Rias Gremory will
lose too much blood and retire.

7423
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:09,240
If you wish to save her, use your Phoenix Tears.

7424
00:14:10,530 --> 00:14:12,160
President...

7425
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:14,700
You did something unnecessary.

7426
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:19,080
If I said that, I'm sure my place
as King would be questioned.

7427
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:21,040
I understand, I will accept it.

7428
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:22,500
I am very sorry.

7429
00:14:28,470 --> 00:14:33,010
To think I would hold you back...
I'm so pathetic.

7430
00:14:33,010 --> 00:14:35,310
President, I'm going to use this.

7431
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:42,820
Lord Sairaorg!

7432
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:46,320
Please don me!

7433
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:47,530
With that, you would be...

7434
00:14:47,530 --> 00:14:48,900
Shut up!

7435
00:14:48,900 --> 00:14:53,620
I decided I would only use that
if the underworld was in danger!

7436
00:14:55,540 --> 00:14:58,660
That man can become even stronger?

7437
00:15:02,290 --> 00:15:04,630
Please use the lion's power.

7438
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:07,420
Issei...

7439
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:14,350
For me, there is no meaning unless
I surpass you at your strongest!

7440
00:15:14,350 --> 00:15:17,270
All our hard work until this
day will have no meaning!

7441
00:15:17,270 --> 00:15:22,100
Today, I will defeat you at
your strongest and win!

7442
00:15:22,100 --> 00:15:24,900
We are fighting for our dreams!

7443
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:29,030
What point is there in defeating
a person who isn't serious?!

7444
00:15:31,990 --> 00:15:34,450
You're so stupid...

7445
00:15:34,450 --> 00:15:38,660
I apologize. I was a fool.

7446
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:41,830
The fact that I couldn't even
imagine this once in a lifetime battle

7447
00:15:41,830 --> 00:15:46,550
that some may never encounter,
makes me so angry with myself.

7448
00:15:46,550 --> 00:15:50,220
Right! Then let us do this, Hyoudou Issei!

7449
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:51,260
Regulus!

7450
00:15:56,390 --> 00:16:01,440
My lion! The king of Nemea!
You who is called the Lion King!

7451
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:04,770
Respond to my rage and transform into my vesture!

7452
00:16:04,770 --> 00:16:06,360
Balance Break!

7453
00:16:11,150 --> 00:16:14,240
Regulus Rey Leather Rex!

7454
00:16:17,530 --> 00:16:20,410
Good job in making me take this seriously.

7455
00:16:20,410 --> 00:16:23,040
I thank you from the bottom of my heart.

7456
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:26,750
Now, try to hit me again
with that powerful Rook!

7457
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:30,920
Yes, here I come! Welsh Dragonic Rook!

7458
00:16:41,100 --> 00:16:43,020
So that was your limit.

7459
00:16:59,620 --> 00:17:02,080
The Juggernaut Drive.

7460
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:06,250
Yes, the Juggernaut Drive.

7461
00:17:06,250 --> 00:17:08,920
Activate the Juggernaut Drive.

7462
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:11,300
What is this?

7463
00:17:11,300 --> 00:17:13,970
I can feel it rising up.

7464
00:17:13,970 --> 00:17:17,050
That is the only thing that will defeat him.

7465
00:17:17,050 --> 00:17:20,970
Resentment, pain, and hatred...

7466
00:17:20,970 --> 00:17:22,890
If you become that...

7467
00:17:22,890 --> 00:17:25,100
He wishes for it as well.

7468
00:17:25,100 --> 00:17:28,900
Juggernaut Drive. Activate it. Juggernaut Drive.

7469
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:34,320
I hate Sairaorg! I want to
erase him from this world!

7470
00:17:41,410 --> 00:17:42,870
The Boob Dragon!

7471
00:17:42,870 --> 00:17:44,500
No!

7472
00:17:45,750 --> 00:17:47,540
Stand up!

7473
00:17:47,540 --> 00:17:49,380
No!

7474
00:17:52,670 --> 00:17:54,470
Don't cry!

7475
00:17:55,470 --> 00:17:59,510
The Boob Dragon told me! Boys shouldn't cry!

7476
00:17:59,510 --> 00:18:01,640
Even if we fall, we have to keep getting up!

7477
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:05,480
We have to become strong
enough to protect the girls!

7478
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:07,480
That's right, everyone!

7479
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:12,690
The Boob Dragon has always stood up
and beaten powerful foes!

7480
00:18:12,690 --> 00:18:14,530
So, we have to cheer him on!

7481
00:18:14,530 --> 00:18:19,070
The Boob Dragon is everyone's hero!

7482
00:18:19,070 --> 00:18:21,580
Do you all love the Boob Dragon?

7483
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:23,240
We do!

7484
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:25,410
I love him too!

7485
00:18:25,410 --> 00:18:29,540
He's super perverted and always
thinks about doing erotic things,

7486
00:18:29,540 --> 00:18:32,000
but he's so passionate and never gives up

7487
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:36,470
and always fights for the ones he loves!
You all know that, right?

7488
00:18:36,470 --> 00:18:38,800
We do!

7489
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:41,890
Then, let's all send him our cheers together!

7490
00:18:41,890 --> 00:18:44,010
Boobs! Boobs!

7491
00:18:44,010 --> 00:18:48,190
Boobs! Boobs! Boobs! Boobs!

7492
00:18:48,190 --> 00:18:57,240
Boobs! Boobs! Boobs! Boobs! Boobs...!

7493
00:18:57,240 --> 00:19:00,910
Hey, Issei. Can you hear it?

7494
00:19:00,910 --> 00:19:04,540
The voices cheering for you are reaching us.

7495
00:19:04,540 --> 00:19:05,830
Red...

7496
00:19:05,830 --> 00:19:10,080
Her hair is even more crimson
than strawberry blond...

7497
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:13,840
That's right. I saw that back then, too.

7498
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:17,420
Crimson red. Like the color of blood.

7499
00:19:17,420 --> 00:19:20,300
But, now, that isn't how I see it.

7500
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:24,850
Kind and warm. A red that
wraps itself around me.

7501
00:19:24,850 --> 00:19:28,270
This color is what started everything for me.

7502
00:19:32,980 --> 00:19:34,520
Hyoudou Issei.

7503
00:19:34,520 --> 00:19:37,030
Activate the Juggernaut Drive.

7504
00:19:37,030 --> 00:19:41,160
Now, let's defeat that man.
With the power of domination.

7505
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:43,910
Shut up. Can't you hear them?

7506
00:19:43,910 --> 00:19:45,830
The voices calling for me!

7507
00:19:45,830 --> 00:19:48,500
The Heavenly Dragon is destined to
become the Dragon of Domination.

7508
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:51,790
No. I won't become the Dragon of Domination!

7509
00:19:51,790 --> 00:19:55,130
I am Hyoudou Issei! I'm just a pervert.

7510
00:19:55,130 --> 00:19:58,510
If I have to be a king, I'll become
the king of pervertedness!

7511
00:19:58,510 --> 00:20:02,930
No, the Dragon of Domination,
the Juggernaut Drive...

7512
00:20:02,930 --> 00:20:05,550
That is the fate we are destined for.

7513
00:20:05,550 --> 00:20:07,310
Why not?

7514
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:13,600
I am one of the
White Dragon Emperor of history.

7515
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:21,150
I am here because you inserted Albion's
gem in your Boosted Gear once before.

7516
00:20:21,150 --> 00:20:23,200
This must be some kind of fate.

7517
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:24,700
Let me help you.

7518
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:25,700
Huh?

7519
00:20:25,700 --> 00:20:28,040
You may be able to push the Heavenly Dragon--

7520
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:35,000
No, the two Heavenly Dragons toward
a new possibility. That is why...

7521
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,880
We won't let you! Hatred!

7522
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:37,960
Grudges!

7523
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:40,340
That is what the Sacred Gear of the
Red Dragon Emperor is made of!

7524
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:43,470
Accumulating curses while spitting hatred!

7525
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:48,850
Boobs. I was saved by them.

7526
00:20:48,850 --> 00:20:51,980
And I'll keep chasing after them!

7527
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:56,520
I, who shall awaken, am the Heavenly Dragon
who stole the principle of domination from God.

7528
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:57,730
I, who shall awaken,

7529
00:20:57,730 --> 00:20:59,980
am the Red Dragon Emperor who tossed
aside the principle of domination!

7530
00:20:59,980 --> 00:21:02,650
I laugh at the infinite and fret over the dream.

7531
00:21:02,650 --> 00:21:06,280
With infinite hope and dreams,
I shall walk the path of king!

7532
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:09,240
I shall become the Red Dragon of Domination.

7533
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:12,000
I shall become the Red Dragon King.

7534
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:15,120
I shall drown you in the
depths of crimson purgatory.

7535
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:20,170
I shall promise you! A future
that shines of deep crimson!

7536
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:25,720
Future? Show us the future?

7537
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:28,010
That's right! I'll show it to you!

7538
00:21:28,010 --> 00:21:30,810
No, let's show everyone the future together!

7539
00:21:30,810 --> 00:21:34,890
To our friends! To the woman we love!
To the children!

7540
00:21:34,890 --> 00:21:38,060
Us, show them the future...

7541
00:21:38,060 --> 00:21:40,320
Let's go, my seniors!

7542
00:21:40,320 --> 00:21:43,740
I'm the Red Dragon Emperor! And the Boob Dragon!

7543
00:21:43,740 --> 00:21:46,240
And the man in love with Rias Gremory!

7544
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:50,240
I'm Hyoudou Issei!

